4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ElnoTLnZMaIQ7kNvwEDlpQJ&_nc_oc=AdoMcISgCOAC0qEH6M_kVMuPUhtaM4zwK4FE2YHbC5TjUc4SlepPE_xvsK6Gol_O98E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2KgU6T7rdSJWhT2VKiC2dnBlh7ARuXEQcIBqASt4B2RA&oe=69F747D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SYpsw-24QGIQ7kNvwE7Yw1X&_nc_oc=AdonBem-yIIYrWSl5KbNP1EpZVMWnGZbsOQ783iWAKfwbKmzA5DjC5dsgI2eahLJk80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2imPlUykH2pshVNrgAezaut9UnX_tLwje1EiSP71WbbA&oe=69F74CB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_Owt_xoxU7oQ7kNvwEzjZ15&_nc_oc=AdpFXbEnKGc3Zi07Mnyx_ko1dku8NFLsni0SoZdQfRMQwz3-5gh8MKgrBhzHWqwekvY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1sps9OMXeOEQdG_Nx4D34ejx8vAwyswzz1r4pWBjN3wA&oe=69F75A55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p